msgstr "ລັອກບັນຊີ %s@%s ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid "The account %s@%s has been successfully unlocked."
msgstr "ປົດລັອກບັນຊີ %s@%s ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid "Username and hostname didn't change. If you only want to change the password, 'Change password' tab should be used."
msgstr "ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ ແລະ ຊື່ໂຮສ໌ (Hostname) ບໍ່ມີການປ່ຽນແປງ. ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນແຕ່ລະຫັດຜ່ານ, ຄວນໃຊ້ແທັບ 'ປ່ຽນລະຫັດຜ່ານ'."

msgid "Thread %s was successfully killed."
msgstr "ຢຸດ (Kill) ເທຣດ %s ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid "phpMyAdmin was unable to kill thread %s. It probably has already been closed."
msgstr "phpMyAdmin ບໍ່ສາມາດຢຸດເທຣດ %s ໄດ້. ມັນອາດຈະຖືກປິດໄປແລ້ວ."

msgid "Other statements"
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງອື່ນໆ"

msgid "Received"
msgstr "ໄດ້ຮັບ"

msgid "Sent"
msgstr "ສົ່ງອອກ"

msgid "Max. concurrent connections"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພ້ອມກັນສູງສຸດ"

msgid "Failed attempts"
msgstr "ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມທີ່ລົ້ມເຫຼວ"

msgid "The number of connections that were aborted because the client died without closing the connection properly."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ຖືກຍົກເລີກ ເພາະໄຄລເອນ (Client) ຢຸດເຮັດວຽກໂດຍບໍ່ໄດ້ປິດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "The number of failed attempts to connect to the MySQL server."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄວາມພະຍາຍາມທີ່ລົ້ມເຫຼວໃນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ MySQL ເຊີເວີ."

msgid "The number of transactions that used the temporary binary log cache but that exceeded the value of binlog_cache_size and used a temporary file to store statements from the transaction."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Transaction ທີ່ໃຊ້ແຄຊ໌ binary log ຊົ່ວຄາວ ແຕ່ມີຂະໜາດເກີນຄ່າຂອງ binlog_cache_size ແລະ ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວເພື່ອເກັບຄຳສັ່ງຈາກ Transaction."

msgid "The number of transactions that used the temporary binary log cache."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Transaction ທີ່ໃຊ້ແຄຊ໌ binary log ຊົ່ວຄາວ."

msgid "The number of connection attempts (successful or not) to the MySQL server."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄວາມພະຍາຍາມເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ MySQL ເຊີເວີ (ທັງທີ່ສຳເລັດ ແລະ ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ)."

msgid "The number of temporary tables on disk created automatically by the server while executing statements. If Created_tmp_disk_tables is big, you may want to increase the tmp_table_size  value to cause temporary tables to be memory-based instead of disk-based."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຕາຕະລາງຊົ່ວຄາວໃນດິສກ໌ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍເຊີເວີໃນຂະນະປະມວນຜົນຄຳສັ່ງ. ຫາກຄ່ານີ້ສູງ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຄ່າ tmp_table_size ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕາຕະລາງຊົ່ວຄາວຖືກສ້າງໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳແທນດິສກ໌."

msgid "How many temporary files mysqld has created."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວທີ່ mysqld ໄດ້ສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "The number of in-memory temporary tables created automatically by the server while executing statements."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຕາຕະລາງຊົ່ວຄາວໃນໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດໂດຍເຊີເວີໃນຂະນະປະມວນຜົນຄຳສັ່ງ."

msgid "The number of rows written with INSERT DELAYED for which some error occurred (probably duplicate key)."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ຂຽນດ້ວຍ INSERT DELAYED ແລ້ວເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ (ອາດຈະເປັນເພາະຄີຊ້ຳ)."

msgid "The number of INSERT DELAYED handler threads in use. Every different table on which one uses INSERT DELAYED gets its own thread."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ thread ຂອງ INSERT DELAYED handler ທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ."

msgid "The number of INSERT DELAYED rows written."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ຂຽນດ້ວຍ INSERT DELAYED."

msgid "The number of executed FLUSH statements."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳສັ່ງ FLUSH ທີ່ໄດ້ປະມວນຜົນ."

msgid "The number of internal COMMIT statements."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳສັ່ງ COMMIT ພາຍໃນ."

msgid "The number of times a row was deleted from a table."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການລຶບແຖວອອກຈາກຕາຕະລາງ."

msgid "The MySQL server can ask the NDB Cluster storage engine if it knows about a table with a given name. This is called discovery. Handler_discover indicates the number of time tables have been discovered."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການຄົ້ນຫາຕາຕະລາງ (discovery) ຜ່ານ NDB Cluster storage engine."

msgid "The number of times the first entry was read from an index. If this is high, it suggests that the server is doing a lot of full index scans; for example, SELECT col1 FROM foo, assuming that col1 is indexed."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການອ່ານລາຍການທຳອິດຈາກ index. ຫາກຄ່ານີ້ສູງ ສະແດງວ່າເຊີເວີກຳລັງເຮັດ full index scans ເປັນຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ."

msgid "The number of requests to read a row based on a key. If this is high, it is a good indication that your queries and tables are properly indexed."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍອ່ານແຖວໂດຍອີງຕາມຄີ (key). ຫາກຄ່ານີ້ສູງ ສະແດງວ່າ Query ແລະ ຕາຕະລາງມີການເຮັດ Index ທີ່ດີແລ້ວ."

msgid "The number of requests to read the next row in key order. This is incremented if you are querying an index column with a range constraint or if you are doing an index scan."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍອ່ານແຖວຖັດໄປຕາມລຳດັບຂອງຄີ."

msgid "The number of requests to read the previous row in key order. This read method is mainly used to optimize ORDER BY … DESC."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍອ່ານແຖວກ່ອນໜ້າຕາມລຳດັບຂອງຄີ. ໃຊ້ເພື່ອປັບແຕ່ງ ORDER BY … DESC."

msgid "The number of requests to read a row based on a fixed position. This is high if you are doing a lot of queries that require sorting of the result. You probably have a lot of queries that require MySQL to scan whole tables or you have joins that don't use keys properly."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍອ່ານແຖວຕາມຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ແນ່ນອນ. ຫາກຄ່ານີ້ສູງ ສະແດງວ່າມີ Query ທີ່ຕ້ອງມີການຈັດລຽງຜົນລັບ ຫຼື ມີການ scan ທັງຕາຕະລາງ ຫຼື ການ join ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ຄີຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "The number of requests to read the next row in the data file. This is high if you are doing a lot of table scans. Generally this suggests that your tables are not properly indexed or that your queries are not written to take advantage of the indexes you have."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍອ່ານແຖວຖັດໄປໃນໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ. ຫາກຄ່ານີ້ສູງ ສະແດງວ່າມີການ scan ຕາຕະລາງຫຼາຍ ເຊິ່ງມັກຈະໝາຍເຖິງຕາຕະລາງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດ Index ຫຼື Query ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ປະໂຫຍດຈາກ Index ທີ່ມີ."

msgid "The number of internal ROLLBACK statements."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳສັ່ງ ROLLBACK ພາຍໃນ."

msgid "The number of requests to update a row in a table."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍແກ້ໄຂແຖວໃນຕາຕະລາງ."

msgid "The number of requests to insert a row in a table."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍເພີ່ມແຖວໃນຕາຕະລາງ."

msgid "The number of pages containing data (dirty or clean)."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Page ທີ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນ (ທັງ dirty ແລະ clean)."

msgid "The number of pages currently dirty."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Page ທີ່ເປັນ dirty ຢູ່ໃນຂະນະນີ້."

msgid "The number of buffer pool pages that have been requested to be flushed."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ buffer pool pages ທີ່ຖືກຮ້ອງຂໍໃຫ້ flush."

msgid "The number of free pages."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Page ທີ່ວ່າງ."

msgid "The number of latched pages in InnoDB buffer pool. These are pages currently being read or written or that can't be flushed or removed for some other reason."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Page ໃນ InnoDB buffer pool ທີ່ຖືກລັອກ (latched) ໄວ້."

msgid "The number of pages busy because they have been allocated for administrative overhead such as row locks or the adaptive hash index. This value can also be calculated as Innodb_buffer_pool_pages_total - Innodb_buffer_pool_pages_free - Innodb_buffer_pool_pages_data."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Page ທີ່ກຳລັງຖືກໃຊ້ງານສຳລັບວຽກບໍລິຫານລະບົບ."

msgid "Total size of buffer pool, in pages."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດທັງໝົດຂອງ buffer pool (ຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນ Page)."

msgid "The number of \"random\" read-aheads InnoDB initiated. This happens when a query is to scan a large portion of a table but in random order."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນລ່ວງໜ້າແບບ \"ສຸ່ມ\" ທີ່ InnoDB ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "The number of sequential read-aheads InnoDB initiated. This happens when InnoDB does a sequential full table scan."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນລ່ວງໜ້າແບບ \"ລຽງລຳດັບ\" ທີ່ InnoDB ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "The number of logical read requests InnoDB has done."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍອ່ານແບບ logical ທີ່ InnoDB ໄດ້ເຮັດ."

msgid "The number of logical reads that InnoDB could not satisfy from buffer pool and had to do a single-page read."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການອ່ານແບບ logical ທີ່ InnoDB ບໍ່ພົບໃນ buffer pool ແລະ ຕ້ອງອ່ານຈາກດິສກ໌."

msgid "Normally, writes to the InnoDB buffer pool happen in the background. However, if it's necessary to read or create a page and no clean pages are available, it's necessary to wait for pages to be flushed first. This counter counts instances of these waits. If the buffer pool size was set properly, this value should be small."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ມີການ flush page ເພາະບໍ່ມີ page ວ່າງໃນ buffer pool. ຫາກຕັ້ງຂະໜາດ buffer pool ຢ່າງເໝາະສົມ ຄ່ານີ້ຄວນຈະໜ້ອຍ."

msgid "The number writes done to the InnoDB buffer pool."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນລົງໃນ InnoDB buffer pool."

msgid "The number of fsync() operations so far."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການເຮັດ fsync() ທັງໝົດທີ່ຜ່ານມາ."

msgid "The current number of pending fsync() operations."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການເຮັດ fsync() ທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງຢູ່."

msgid "The current number of pending reads."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການອ່ານທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງຢູ່."

msgid "The current number of pending writes."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການຂຽນທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງຢູ່."

msgid "The amount of data read so far, in bytes."
msgstr "ປະລິມານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອ່ານໄປແລ້ວ (ຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນໄບຕ໌)."

msgid "The total number of data reads."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທັງໝົດໃນການອ່ານຂໍ້ມູນ."

msgid "The total number of data writes."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທັງໝົດໃນການຂຽນຂໍ້ມູນ."

msgid "The amount of data written so far, in bytes."
msgstr "ປະລິມານຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຂຽນໄປແລ້ວ (ຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນໄບຕ໌)."

msgid "The number of pages that have been written for doublewrite operations."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Page ທີ່ຂຽນສຳລັບການເຮັດ doublewrite."

msgid "The number of doublewrite operations that have been performed."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການເຮັດ doublewrite."

msgid "The number of waits we had because log buffer was too small and we had to wait for it to be flushed before continuing."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າເພາະ log buffer ນ້ອຍເກີນໄປ."

msgid "The number of log write requests."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຂຽນ log."

msgid "The number of physical writes to the log file."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ມີການຂຽນລົງໄຟລ໌ log ແທ້ໆ."

msgid "The number of fsync() writes done to the log file."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການຂຽນແບບ fsync() ລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ log."

msgid "The number of pending log file fsyncs."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ fsync ຂອງໄຟລ໌ log ທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງຢູ່."

msgid "Pending log file writes."
msgstr "ການຂຽນໄຟລ໌ log ທີ່ຍັງຄ້າງຢູ່."

msgid "The number of bytes written to the log file."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນໄບຕ໌ທີ່ຂຽນລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ log."

msgid "The number of pages created."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Page ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນ."

msgid "The compiled-in InnoDB page size (default 16KB). Many values are counted in pages; the page size allows them to be easily converted to bytes."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ Page ຂອງ InnoDB (ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 16KB)."

msgid "The number of pages read."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Page ທີ່ຖືກອ່ານ."

msgid "The number of pages written."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ Page ທີ່ຖືກຂຽນ."

msgid "The number of row locks currently being waited for."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ຖືກລັອກ ແລະ ກຳລັງລໍຖ້າຢູ່ໃນຂະນະນີ້."

msgid "The average time to acquire a row lock, in milliseconds."
msgstr "ເວລາສະເລ່ຍໃນການຂໍລັອກແຖວ (ຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນມິລລິວິນາທີ)."

msgid "The total time spent in acquiring row locks, in milliseconds."
msgstr "ເວລາທັງໝົດທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຂໍລັອກແຖວ (ຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນມິລລິວິນາທີ)."

msgid "The maximum time to acquire a row lock, in milliseconds."
msgstr "ເວລາດົນທີ່ສຸດໃນການຂໍລັອກແຖວ (ຫົວໜ່ວຍເປັນມິລລິວິນາທີ)."

msgid "The number of times a row lock had to be waited for."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າການລັອກແຖວ."

msgid "The number of rows deleted from InnoDB tables."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກຕາຕະລາງ InnoDB."

msgid "The number of rows inserted in InnoDB tables."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນຕາຕະລາງ InnoDB."

msgid "The number of rows read from InnoDB tables."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ຖືກອ່ານຈາກຕາຕະລາງ InnoDB."

msgid "The number of rows updated in InnoDB tables."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນຕາຕະລາງ InnoDB."

msgid "The number of key blocks in the key cache that have changed but haven't yet been flushed to disk. It used to be known as Not_flushed_key_blocks."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ key blocks ໃນ key cache ທີ່ຖືກແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຂຽນລົງດິສກ໌."

msgid "The number of unused blocks in the key cache. You can use this value to determine how much of the key cache is in use."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ block ທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ໃນ key cache."

msgid "The number of used blocks in the key cache. This value is a high-water mark that indicates the maximum number of blocks that have ever been in use at one time."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ block ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ງານໃນ key cache (ຄ່າສູງສຸດທີ່ເຄີຍໃຊ້)."

msgid "Percentage of used key cache (calculated value)"
msgstr "ເປີເຊັນຂອງ key cache ທີ່ຖືກໃຊ້ງານ (ຄ່າຈາກການຄິດໄລ່)"

msgid "The number of requests to read a key block from the cache."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍອ່ານ key block ຈາກແຄຊ໌."

msgid "The number of physical reads of a key block from disk. If Key_reads is big, then your key_buffer_size value is probably too small. The cache miss rate can be calculated as Key_reads/Key_read_requests."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການອ່ານ key block ຈາກດິສກ໌. ຫາກຄ່ານີ້ສູງ ສະແດງວ່າຄ່າ key_buffer_size ອາດຈະນ້ອຍເກີນໄປ."

msgid "Key cache miss calculated as rate of physical reads compared to read requests (calculated value)"
msgstr "ອັດຕາການພາດແຄຊ໌ຄີ (Key cache miss) ຄິດໄລ່ຈາກອັດຕາການອ່ານຈິງທຽບກັບການຮ້ອງຂໍການອ່ານ (ຄ່າທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກການຄິດໄລ່)"

msgid "The number of requests to write a key block to the cache."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຂຽນ key block ລົງໃນແຄຊ໌."

msgid "The number of physical writes of a key block to disk."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການຂຽນ key block ລົງໃນດິສກ໌ແທ້ໆ."

msgid "Percentage of physical writes compared to write requests (calculated value)"
msgstr "ເປີເຊັນການຂຽນຈິງທຽບກັບການຮ້ອງຂໍການຂຽນ (ຄ່າທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກການຄິດໄລ່)"

msgid "The total cost of the last compiled query as computed by the query optimizer. Useful for comparing the cost of different query plans for the same query. The default value of 0 means that no query has been compiled yet."
msgstr "ຄ່າໃຊ້ຈ່າຍ (Cost) ທັງໝົດຂອງ query ສຸດທ້າຍ ທີ່ຄິດໄລ່ໂດຍ query optimizer."

msgid "The maximum number of connections that have been in use simultaneously since the server started."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ພ້ອມກັນສູງສຸດ ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມເຊີເວີ."

msgid "The number of rows waiting to be written in INSERT DELAYED queues."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ລໍຖ້າຂຽນໃນຄິວຂອງ INSERT DELAYED."

msgid "The number of tables that have been opened. If opened tables is big, your table_open_cache value is probably too small."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຕາຕະລາງທີ່ຖືກເປີດແລ້ວ. ຖ້າຈຳນວນການເປີດຕາຕະລາງມີຫຼາຍ, ຄ່າ table_open_cache ຂອງທ່ານອາດຈະນ້ອຍເກີນໄປ."

msgid "The number of files that are open."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ເປີດຢູ່."

msgid "The number of streams that are open (used mainly for logging)."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ stream ທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ (ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບການເຮັດ log)."

msgid "The number of tables that are open."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຕາຕະລາງທີ່ເປີດຢູ່."

msgid "The number of free memory blocks in query cache. High numbers can indicate fragmentation issues, which may be solved by issuing a FLUSH QUERY CACHE statement."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ memory block ທີ່ວ່າງໃນ query cache."

msgid "The amount of free memory for query cache."
msgstr "ປະລິມານໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ວ່າງສຳລັບ query cache."

msgid "The number of cache hits."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ພົບຂໍ້ມູນໃນແຄຊ໌ (Cache hits)."

msgid "The number of queries added to the cache."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ query ທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນແຄຊ໌."

msgid "The number of queries that have been removed from the cache to free up memory for caching new queries. This information can help you tune the query cache size. The query cache uses a least recently used (LRU) strategy to decide which queries to remove from the cache."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ query ທີ່ຖືກລຶບອອກຈາກແຄຊ໌ເພື່ອເພີ່ມບ່ອນວ່າງ."

msgid "The number of non-cached queries (not cachable, or not cached due to the query_cache_type setting)."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ query ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເກັບໃນແຄຊ໌."

msgid "The number of queries registered in the cache."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ query ທີ່ລົງທະບຽນໄວ້ໃນແຄຊ໌."

msgid "The total number of blocks in the query cache."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ block ທັງໝົດໃນ query cache."

msgid "The status of failsafe replication (not yet implemented)."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຂອງ failsafe replication (ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້)."

msgid "The number of joins that do not use indexes. If this value is not 0, you should carefully check the indexes of your tables."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການ join ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ Index."

msgid "The number of joins that used a range search on a reference table."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການ join ທີ່ໃຊ້ການຄົ້ນຫາແບບຊ່ວງ (range search) ໃນຕາຕະລາງອ້າງອີງ."

msgid "The number of joins without keys that check for key usage after each row. (If this is not 0, you should carefully check the indexes of your tables.)"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມ (join) ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຄີ ທີ່ກວດສອບການໃຊ້ຄີຫຼັງຈາກແຕ່ລະແຖວ. (ຖ້າຄ່ານີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນ 0, ທ່ານຄວນກວດສອບອິນເດັກ (index) ຂອງຕາຕະລາງໃຫ້ລະອຽດ.)"

msgid "The number of joins that used ranges on the first table. (It's normally not critical even if this is big.)"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມ (join) ທີ່ໃຊ້ຊ່ວງຂໍ້ມູນໃນຕາຕະລາງທຳອິດ. (ປົກກະຕິແລ້ວບໍ່ເປັນບັນຫາຮ້າຍແຮງ ເຖິງວ່າຈະມີຄ່າຫຼາຍກໍຕາມ.)"

msgid "The number of joins that did a full scan of the first table."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການ join ທີ່ເຮັດ full scan ໃນຕາຕະລາງທຳອິດ."

msgid "The number of temporary tables currently open by the replica SQL thread."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຕາຕະລາງຊົ່ວຄາວທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ໂດຍ replica SQL thread."

msgid "Total (since startup) number of times the replication replica SQL thread has retried transactions."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທັງໝົດ (ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມລະບົບ) ທີ່ replication replica SQL thread ໄດ້ລອງເຮັດທຸລະກຳ (transactions) ຄືນໃໝ່."

msgid "This is ON if this server is a replica that is connected to a primary."
msgstr "ສະຖານະຈະເປັນ ON ຫາກເຊີເວີນີ້ເປັນເຄື່ອງສຳຮອງ (replica) ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບເຄື່ອງຫຼັກ (primary)."

msgid "The number of threads that have taken more than slow_launch_time seconds to create."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ thread ທີ່ໃຊ້ເວລາສ້າງດົນເກີນຄ່າ slow_launch_time."

msgid "The number of queries that have taken more than long_query_time seconds."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ query ທີ່ໃຊ້ເວລາດົນເກີນຄ່າ long_query_time."

msgid "The number of merge passes the sort algorithm has had to do. If this value is large, you should consider increasing the value of the sort_buffer_size system variable."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ merge passes ທີ່ algorithm ການຈັດລຽງຕ້ອງເຮັດ."

msgid "The number of sorts that were done with ranges."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການຈັດລຽງທີ່ເຮັດດ້ວຍຊ່ວງ (ranges)."

msgid "The number of sorted rows."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນແຖວທີ່ຖືກຈັດລຽງແລ້ວ."

msgid "The number of sorts that were done by scanning the table."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການຈັດລຽງທີ່ເຮັດໂດຍການ scan ຕາຕະລາງ."

msgid "The number of times that a table lock was acquired immediately."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ສາມາດລັອກຕາຕະລາງໄດ້ທັນທີ."

msgid "The number of times that a table lock could not be acquired immediately and a wait was needed. If this is high, and you have performance problems, you should first optimize your queries, and then either split your table or tables or use replication."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຄັ້ງທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດລັອກຕາຕະລາງໄດ້ທັນທີ ແລະ ຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າ."

msgid "The number of threads in the thread cache. The cache hit rate can be calculated as Threads_created/Connections. If this value is red you should raise your thread_cache_size."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ thread ໃນ thread cache."

msgid "The number of currently open connections."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ໃນຂະນະນີ້."

msgid "The number of threads created to handle connections. If Threads_created is big, you may want to increase the thread_cache_size value. (Normally this doesn't give a notable performance improvement if you have a good thread implementation.)"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນເທຣດ (threads) ທີ່ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເພື່ອຈັດການການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່. ຫາກ Threads_created ມີຄ່າສູງ, ເຈົ້າອາດຈະຕ້ອງເພີ່ມຄ່າຂອງ thread_cache_size. (ໂດຍປົກກະຕິແລ້ວ ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະບໍ່ໄດ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ປະສິດທິພາບດີຂຶ້ນຢ່າງເຫັນໄດ້ຊັດເຈນ ຫາກເຈົ້າມີການຈັດການເທຣດທີ່ດີແລ້ວ.)"

msgid "Thread cache hit rate (calculated value)"
msgstr "ອັດຕາການພົບແຄຊ໌ເທຣດ (ຄ່າທີ່ໄດ້ຈາກການຄິດໄລ່)"

msgid "The number of threads that are not sleeping."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນ thread ທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ຢູ່ໃສສະຖານະຫຼັບ (sleeping)."

msgid "User groups management is not enabled."
msgstr "ການຈັດການກຸ່ມຜູ້ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກເປີດນຳໃຊ້."

msgid "Setting variable failed"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າຕົວປ່ຽນຫຼົ້ມເຫຼວ"

msgid "Configuration already exists, setup is disabled!"
msgstr "ມີການກຳນົດຄ່າຢູ່ແລ້ວ, ການຕິດຕັ້ງຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ!"

msgid "Incorrect form specified!"
msgstr "ລະບຸຟອມບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ!"

msgid "You are not using a secure connection; all data (including potentially sensitive information, like passwords) is transferred unencrypted!"
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ປອດໄພ; ຂໍ້ມູນທັງໝົດ (ລວມທັງຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອາດລະອຽດອ່ອນ ເຊັ່ນ: ລະຫັດຜ່ານ) ຈະຖືກສົ່ງໂດຍບໍ່ມີການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ!"

msgid "If your server is also configured to accept HTTPS requests follow this link to use a secure connection."
msgstr "ຖ້າເຊີເວີຂອງທ່ານຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບ HTTPS, ກະລຸນາຄລິກລິ້ງນີ້ເພື່ອໃຊ້ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ທີ່ປອດໄພ."

msgid "Insecure connection"
msgstr "ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ບໍ່ປອດໄພ"

msgid "Wrong data"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ"

msgid "Wrong data or no validation for %s"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີການກວດສອບສຳລັບ %s"

msgid "Bookmark %s has been created."
msgstr "ສ້າງ Bookmark %s ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Bookmark not created!"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງບຸກມາກໄດ້!"

msgid "Table %1$s has been altered successfully."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂໂຄງສ້າງຕາຕະລາງ %1$s ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid "No row selected."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີແຖວທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid "No SQL query was set to fetch data."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີຄຳສັ່ງ SQL ຖືກກຳນົດເພື່ອດຶງຂໍ້ມູນ."

msgid "No numeric columns present in the table to plot."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີຄໍລຳຕົວເລກໃນຕາຕະລາງທີ່ຈະນຳມາສ້າງແຜນພູມ."

msgid "No data to display"
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຈະສະແດງ"

msgid "'%s' database does not exist."
msgstr "ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ '%s' ບໍ່ມີຢູ່."

msgid "Table %s already exists!"
msgstr "ຕາຕະລາງ %s ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວ!"

msgid "No column selected."
msgstr "ບໍ່ໄດ້ເລືອກຄໍລຳ."

msgid "%1$d column has been dropped successfully."
msgid_plural "%1$d columns have been dropped successfully."
msgstr[0] "ລຶບ %1$d ຖັນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid "Invalid table name"
msgstr "ຊື່ຕາຕະລາງບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ"

msgid "There is an issue with your request."
msgstr "ມີບັນຫາກັບການຮ້ອງຂໍຂອງທ່ານ."

msgid "MySQL returned an empty result set (i.e. zero rows)."
msgstr "MySQL ສົ່ງຄ່າຜົນລັດຫວ່າງເປົ່າ (ຄື: ສູນແຖວ)."

msgid "No spatial column found for this SQL query."
msgstr "ບໍ່ພົບຄໍລຳທາງພື້ນທີ່ (Spatial) ສຳລັບຄຳສັ່ງ SQL ນີ້."

msgid "Invalid file format, expected one of: "
msgstr "ຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ, ຕ້ອງແມ່ນໜຶ່ງໃນ: "

msgid "Failed to create image"
msgstr "ສ້າງຮູບພາບລົ້ມເຫຼວ"

msgid "Maintenance operations on multiple tables are disabled."
msgstr "ການບຳລຸງຮັກສາຫຼາຍຕາຕະລາງພ້ອມກັນຖືກປິດໄວ້."

msgid "The partition name must be a non-empty string."
msgstr "ຊື່ພາທິຊັນ (Partition) ຕ້ອງບໍ່ເປັນຄ່າວ່າງ."

msgid "Invalid database or table name."
msgstr "ຊື່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ ຫຼື ຊື່ຕາຕະລາງບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "Display column was successfully updated."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຄໍລຳການສະແດງຜົນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid "Internal relationships were successfully updated."
msgstr "ອັບເດດຄວາມສຳພັນພາຍໃນສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid "Row: %1$s, Column: %2$s, Error: %3$s"
msgstr "ແຖວ: %1$s, ຄໍລຳ: %2$s, ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: %3$s"

msgid "Invalid request parameter."
msgstr "ພາຣາມິເຕີຂອງຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "The columns have been moved successfully."
msgstr "ຍ້າຍຄໍລຳສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid "The selected columns do not match the columns in the table."
msgstr "ຄໍລຳທີ່ເລືອກບໍ່ກົງກັບຄໍລຳທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຕາຕະລາງ."

msgid "The selected columns are already in the correct order."
msgstr "ຄໍລຳທີ່ເລືອກຖືກຈັດລຽງຖືກຕ້ອງແລ້ວ."

msgid "Query error"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດຂອງຄຳສັ່ງ"

msgid "The name '%s' is a MySQL reserved keyword."
msgid_plural "The names '%s' are MySQL reserved keywords."
msgstr[0] "ຊື່ '%s' ເປັນຄຳສະຫງວນຂອງ MySQL."

msgid "Table %1$s has been altered successfully. Privileges have been adjusted."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂຕາຕະລາງ %1$s ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ ແລະ ປັບປ່ຽນສິດການເຂົ້າເຖິງແລ້ວ."

msgid "Tracking of %s is activated."
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມ %s ຖືກເປີດໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ."

msgid "SQL statements executed."
msgstr "ປະມວນຜົນຄຳສັ່ງ SQL ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Tracking versions deleted successfully."
msgstr "ລຶບເວີຊັນການຕິດຕາມສຳເລັດແລ້ວ."

msgid "No versions selected."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີເວີຊັນທີ່ຖືກເລືອກ."

msgid "Add trigger"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ Trigger"

msgid "Edit trigger"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂ Trigger"

msgid "No trigger with name %1$s found in database %2$s."
msgstr "ບໍ່ພົບ Trigger ທີ່ມີຊື່ %1$s ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ %2$s."

msgid "Error in processing request: No trigger with name %1$s found in database %2$s."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: ບໍ່ພົບ trigger ຊື່ %1$s ໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ %2$s."

msgid "You don't have sufficient privileges to be here right now!"
msgstr "ທ່ານບໍ່ມີສິດພຽງພໍທີ່ຈະເຂົ້າເຖິງບ່ອນນີ້ໃນເວລານີ້!"

msgid "View name can not be empty!"
msgstr "ຊື່ຂອງ View ບໍ່ສາມາດຫວ່າງເປົ່າໄດ້!"

msgid "The %s extension is missing. Please check your PHP configuration."
msgstr "ສ່ວນເສີມ %s ຫາຍໄປ. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າ PHP ຂອງທ່ານ."

msgid "Could not add %1$s as they already exist in central list!"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມ %1$s ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກມັນມີຢູ່ໃນລາຍການກາງແລ້ວ!"

msgid "Could not add columns!"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມຖັນໄດ້!"

msgid "Couldn't remove Column(s) %1$s as they don't exist in central columns list!"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບຖັນ %1$s ໄດ້ ເນື່ອງຈາກພວກມັນບໍ່ມີຢູ່ໃນລາຍການຖັນກາງ!"

msgid "Could not remove columns!"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບຖັນໄດ້!"

msgid "The configuration storage is not ready for the central list of columns feature."
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນການຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍ່ພ້ອມສຳລັບຟີເຈີລາຍການຖັນກາງ (Central list of columns)."

msgctxt "phpMyAdmin configuration storage is not configured for \"Display Features\" on designer when user tries to set a display field."
msgid "phpMyAdmin configuration storage is not configured for \"Display Features\"."
msgstr "ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າບ່ອນເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ phpMyAdmin ສຳລັບ \"Display Features\"."

msgid "Error: relationship already exists."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: ມີຄວາມສຳພັນນີ້ຢູ່ແລ້ວ."

msgid "FOREIGN KEY relationship has been added."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄວາມສຳພັນ FOREIGN KEY ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Error: FOREIGN KEY relationship could not be added!"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: ບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມຄວາມສຳພັນ FOREIGN KEY ໄດ້!"

msgid "Error: Missing index on column(s)."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: ຄໍລຳທີ່ເລືອກບໍ່ມີອິນເດັກ."

msgid "Error: Relational features are disabled!"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: ຄຸນສົມບັດຄວາມສຳພັນຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານ!"

msgid "Internal relationship has been added."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຄວາມສຳພັນພາຍໃນແລ້ວ."

msgid "Error: Internal relationship could not be added!"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: ບໍ່ສາມາດເພີ່ມຄວາມສຳພັນພາຍໃນໄດ້!"

msgid "FOREIGN KEY relationship has been removed."
msgstr "ລຶບຄວາມສຳພັນ FOREIGN KEY ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Error: Internal relationship could not be removed!"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: ບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບຄວາມສຳພັນພາຍໃນໄດ້!"

msgid "Internal relationship has been removed."
msgstr "ລຶບຄວາມສຳພັນພາຍໃນແລ້ວ."

msgid "Could not load schema plugins, please check your installation!"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດໂຫຼດປລັກອິນ schema ໄດ້!"

msgid "Invalid routine type: \"%s\""
msgstr "ປະເພດ Routine ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ: \"%s\""

msgid "Routine %1$s has been created."
msgstr "Routine %1$s ຖືກສ້າງແລ້ວ."

msgid "One or more errors have occurred while processing your request:"
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໜຶ່ງຢ່າງ ຫຼື ຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃນຂະນະທີ່ກຳລັງປະມວນຜົນຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຂອງທ່ານ:"

msgid "Sorry, we failed to restore the dropped routine."
msgstr "ຂໍໂທດ, ບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນ Routine ທີ່ຖືກລຶບໄປໄດ້."

msgid "The backed up query was:"
msgstr "Query ທີ່ສຳຮອງໄວ້ຄື:"

msgid "MySQL said: "
msgstr "MySQL ແຈ້ງວ່າ: "

msgid "Routine %1$s has been modified. Privileges have been adjusted."
msgstr "Routine %1$s ຖືກແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ. ສິດການໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຖືກປັບປຸງແລ້ວ."

msgid "Routine %1$s has been modified."
msgstr "Routine %1$s ຖືກແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ."

msgid "You must provide a name and a type for each routine parameter."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸຊື່ ແລະ ປະເພດໃຫ້ກັບແຕ່ລະພາລາມິເຕີຂອງ Routine."

msgid "Invalid direction \"%s\" given for parameter."
msgstr "ທິດທາງ \"%s\" ທີ່ລະບຸໃຫ້ພາລາມິເຕີບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

msgid "You must provide length/values for routine parameters of type ENUM, SET, VARCHAR and VARBINARY."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸ ຄວາມຍາວ/ຄ່າ ໃຫ້ກັບພາລາມິເຕີຂອງ Routine ທີ່ເປັນປະເພດ ENUM, SET, VARCHAR ແລະ VARBINARY."

msgid "You must provide a valid return type for the routine."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸປະເພດການສົ່ງຄ່າກັບ (Return type) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃຫ້ກັບ Routine."

msgid "The definer must be in the \"username@hostname\" format!"
msgstr "ຜູ້ກຳນົດຕ້ອງຢູ່ໃນຮູບແບບ \"ຊື່ຜູ້ໃຊ້@ຊື່ໂຮສ\"!"

msgid "Invalid routine type!"
msgstr "ປະເພດຣູທີນບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ!"

msgid "You must provide a routine name!"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸຊື່ Routine!"

msgid "You must provide a routine definition."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸຄຳນິຍາມໃຫ້ກັບ Routine."

msgid "Execution results of routine %s"
msgstr "ຜົນການປະມວນຜົນຂອງ Routine %s"

msgid "%d row affected by the last statement inside the procedure."
msgid_plural "%d rows affected by the last statement inside the procedure."
msgstr[0] "ມີ %d ແຖວທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຜົນກະທົບຈາກຄຳສັ່ງສຸດທ້າຍພາຍໃນ Procedure."

msgid "The following query has failed: \"%s\""
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງ Query ຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ລົ້ມເຫຼວ: \"%s\""

msgid "Unable to use timezone \"%1$s\" for server %2$d. Please check your configuration setting for [em]$cfg['Servers'][%3$d]['SessionTimeZone'][/em]. phpMyAdmin is currently using the default time zone of the database server."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ເຂດເວລາ \\\"%1$s\\\" ສຳລັບເຊີເວີ %2$d. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານສຳລັບ [em]$cfg['Servers'][%3$d]['SessionTimeZone'][/em]. ປັດຈຸບັນ phpMyAdmin ແມ່ນກຳລັງໃຊ້ເຂດເວລາເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຂອງຖານຂໍ້ມູນເຊີເວີ."

msgid "Failed to set configured collation connection!"
msgstr "ກຳນົດຄ່າການສົມທຽບ (collation) ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ!"

msgid "Error 1045: Access denied for user. Additional error information may be available, but is being hidden by the %s configuration directive."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ 1045: ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງ. ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໂດຍ %s."

msgid "The row has been deleted."
msgstr "ລຶບແຖວແລ້ວ."

msgid "Query took %01.4f seconds."
msgstr "ຄຳສັ່ງໃຊ້ເວລາ %01.4f ວິນາທີ."

msgid "Showing rows %1s - %2s"
msgstr "ກຳລັງສະແດງແຖວທີ %1s - %2s"

msgid "%1$s total, %2$s in query"
msgstr "ທັງໝົດ %1$s, ໃນຄຳສັ່ງສອບຖາມ %2$s"

msgid "%s total"
msgstr "ທັງໝົດ %s"

msgid "Link not found!"
msgstr "ບໍ່ພົບລິ້ງ!"

msgid "Data home directory"
msgstr "ໂຟນເດີເກັບຂໍ້ມູນຫຼັກ"

msgid "The common part of the directory path for all InnoDB data files."
msgstr "ເສັ້ນທາງໂຟນເດີທົ່ວໄປສຳລັບໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ InnoDB ທັງໝົດ."

msgid "Data files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ"

msgid "Autoextend increment"
msgstr "ການເພີ່ມຂະໜາດອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

msgid "The increment size for extending the size of an autoextending tablespace when it becomes full."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດທີ່ເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນເມື່ອ tablespace ເຕັມ."

msgid "Buffer pool size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ Buffer pool"

msgid "The size of the memory buffer InnoDB uses to cache data and indexes of its tables."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງ memory buffer ທີ່ InnoDB ໃຊ້ເພື່ອ cache ຂໍ້ມູນ ແລະ ອິນເດັກ."

msgid "Buffer Pool"
msgstr "Buffer Pool"

msgid "InnoDB Status"
msgstr "ສະຖານະ InnoDB"

msgid "Data pointer size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງຕົວຊີ້ຂໍ້ມູນ (Data pointer size)"

msgid "The default pointer size in bytes, to be used by CREATE TABLE for MyISAM tables when no MAX_ROWS option is specified."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຕົວຊີ້ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເປັນໄບຕ໌."

msgid "Automatic recovery mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດກູ້ຄືນອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

msgid "The mode for automatic recovery of crashed MyISAM tables, as set via the --myisam-recover server startup option."
msgstr "ໂໝດການກູ້ຄືນອັດຕະໂນມັດສຳລັບຕາຕະລາງ MyISAM ທີ່ເສຍຫາຍ."

msgid "Maximum size for temporary sort files"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວສຳລັບການຈັດລຽງ"

msgid "The maximum size of the temporary file MySQL is allowed to use while re-creating a MyISAM index (during REPAIR TABLE, ALTER TABLE, or LOAD DATA INFILE)."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວທີ່ MySQL ອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ໃຊ້."

msgid "Maximum size for temporary files on index creation"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວເມື່ອສ້າງອິນເດັກ"

msgid "If the temporary file used for fast MyISAM index creation would be larger than using the key cache by the amount specified here, prefer the key cache method."
msgstr "ຫາກໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວໃຫຍ່ກວ່າຄ່າທີ່ກຳນົດ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ວິທີ key cache ແທນ."

msgid "Repair threads"
msgstr "Thread ສຳລັບການຊ້ອມແຊມ"

msgid "If this value is greater than 1, MyISAM table indexes are created in parallel (each index in its own thread) during the repair by sorting process."
msgstr "ຫາກຄ່ານີ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ 1, ອິນເດັກຂອງ MyISAM ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນພ້ອມກັນ."

msgid "Sort buffer size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ Buffer ສຳລັບການຈັດລຽງ"

msgid "The buffer that is allocated when sorting MyISAM indexes during a REPAIR TABLE or when creating indexes with CREATE INDEX or ALTER TABLE."
msgstr "Buffer ທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນການຈັດລຽງອິນເດັກ MyISAM."

msgid "Index cache size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ Index cache"

msgid "This is the amount of memory allocated to the index cache. Default value is 32MB. The memory allocated here is used only for caching index pages."
msgstr "ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ index cache. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 32MB."

msgid "Record cache size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ Record cache"

msgid "This is the amount of memory allocated to the record cache used to cache table data. The default value is 32MB. This memory is used to cache changes to the handle data (.xtd) and row pointer (.xtr) files."
msgstr "ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ record cache. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 32MB."

msgid "Log cache size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ Log cache"

msgid "The amount of memory allocated to the transaction log cache used to cache on transaction log data. The default is 16MB."
msgstr "ໜ່ວຍຄວາມຈຳທີ່ໃຊ້ສຳລັບ transaction log cache. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 16MB."

msgid "Log file threshold"
msgstr "ຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງໄຟລ໌ລັອກ"

msgid "The size of a transaction log before rollover, and a new log is created. The default value is 16MB."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງ transaction log ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 16MB."

msgid "Transaction buffer size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ Transaction buffer"

msgid "The size of the global transaction log buffer (the engine allocates 2 buffers of this size). The default is 1MB."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງ global transaction log buffer. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 1MB."

msgid "Checkpoint frequency"
msgstr "ຄວາມຖີ່ຂອງ Checkpoint"

msgid "The amount of data written to the transaction log before a checkpoint is performed. The default value is 24MB."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຂຽນລົງ transaction log ກ່ອນເຮັດ checkpoint. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 24MB."

msgid "Data log threshold"
msgstr "ຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງ Data log"

msgid "The maximum size of a data log file. The default value is 64MB. PBXT can create a maximum of 32000 data logs, which are used by all tables. So the value of this variable can be increased to increase the total amount of data that can be stored in the database."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດສູງສຸດຂອງໄຟລ໌ data log. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 64MB."

msgid "Garbage threshold"
msgstr "ຂີດຈຳກັດຂອງຂໍ້ມູນຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ (Garbage threshold)"

msgid "The percentage of garbage in a data log file before it is compacted. This is a value between 1 and 99. The default is 50."
msgstr "ເປີເຊັນຂອງຂໍ້ມູນຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກບີບອັດ. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 50."

msgid "Log buffer size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດ Log buffer"

msgid "The size of the buffer used when writing a data log. The default is 256MB. The engine allocates one buffer per thread, but only if the thread is required to write a data log."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດຂອງ buffer ທີ່ໃຊ້ເມື່ອຂຽນ data log. ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແມ່ນ 256MB."

msgid "Data file grow size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດການຂະຫຍາຍຂອງໄຟລ໌ຂໍ້ມູນ"

msgid "The grow size of the handle data (.xtd) files."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດການຂະຫຍາຍຂອງໄຟລ໌ (.xtd)."

msgid "Row file grow size"
msgstr "ຂະໜາດການຂະຫຍາຍຂອງໄຟລ໌ແຖວ"

msgid "The grow size of the row pointer (.xtr) files."
msgstr "ຂະໜາດການຂະຫຍາຍຂອງໄຟລ໌ (.xtr)."

msgid "Log file count"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ລັອກ"

msgid "This is the number of transaction log files (pbxt/system/xlog*.xt) the system will maintain. If the number of logs exceeds this value then old logs will be deleted, otherwise they are renamed and given the next highest number."
msgstr "ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ transaction log ທີ່ລະບົບຈະເກັບໄວ້."

msgid "Documentation and further information about PBXT can be found on the %sPrimeBase XT Home Page%s."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງເອກະສານ ແລະ ຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ PBXT ໄດ້ທີ່ %sPrimeBase XT Home Page%s."

msgid "Too many error messages, some are not displayed."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມຜິດພາດຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ, ບາງອັນຈຶ່ງບໍ່ໄດ້ສະແດງອອກມາ."

msgid "Report"
msgstr "ລາຍງານ"

msgid "Event %1$s has been created."
msgstr "Event %1$s ຖືກສ້າງແລ້ວ."

msgid "Sorry, we failed to restore the dropped event."
msgstr "ຂໍໂທດ, ບໍ່ສາມາດກູ້ຄືນ Event ທີ່ຖືກລຶບໄປໄດ້."

msgid "Event %1$s has been modified."
msgstr "Event %1$s ຖືກແກ້ໄຂແລ້ວ."

msgid "You must provide an event name!"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸຊື່ Event!"

msgid "You must provide a valid interval value for the event."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸຄ່າຊ່ວງເວລາ (Interval) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃຫ້ກັບ Event."

msgid "You must provide a valid execution time for the event."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸເວລາປະມວນຜົນທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃຫ້ກັບ Event."

msgid "You must provide a valid type for the event."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸປະເພດທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງໃຫ້ກັບ Event."

msgid "You must provide an event definition."
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງລະບຸຄຳນິຍາມ (Definition) ໃຫ້ກັບ Event."

msgid "Cannot log in to the database server."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບເຊີເວີຖານຂໍ້ມູນໄດ້."

msgid "Access denied!"
msgstr "ຖືກປະຕິເສດການເຂົ້າເຖິງ!"

msgid "Login without a password is forbidden by configuration (see AllowNoPassword)."
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບໂດຍບໍ່ມີລະຫັດຜ່ານຖືກຫ້າມໂດຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າ (ເບິ່ງ AllowNoPassword)."

msgid "You have been automatically logged out due to inactivity of %s seconds. Once you log in again, you should be able to resume the work where you left off."
msgstr "ທ່ານຖືກອອກຈາກລະບົບໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເນື່ອງຈາກບໍ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວເປັນເວລາ %s ວິນາທີ. ເມື່ອທ່ານເຂົ້າສູ່ລະບົບອີກຄັ້ງ, ທ່ານຈະສາມາດເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ຈາກບ່ອນທີ່ຄ້າງໄວ້ໄດ້."

msgid "Insufficient space to save the file %s."
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ບໍ່ພຽງພໍເພື່ອບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ %s."

msgid "File %s already exists on server, change filename or check overwrite option."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ %s ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໃນເຊີເວີ, ກະລຸນາປ່ຽນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ ຫຼື ກວດເບິ່ງຕົວເລືອກການຂຽນທັບ."

msgid "The web server does not have permission to save the file %s."
msgstr "ເວັບເຊີເວີບໍ່ມີສິດໃນການບັນທຶກໄຟລ໌ %s."

msgid "Dump has been saved to file %s."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນ (Dump) ໄດ້ຖືກບັນທຶກລົງໃນໄຟລ໌ %s ແລ້ວ."

msgid "Could not save recent table!"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດບັນທຶກຕາຕະລາງຫຼ້າສຸດໄດ້!"

msgid "Could not save favorite table!"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດບັນທຶກຕາຕະລາງທີ່ມັກໄດ້!"

msgid "File was not an uploaded file."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ບໍ່ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກອັບໂຫລດ."

msgid "The uploaded file exceeds the upload_max_filesize directive in php.ini."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ອັບໂຫລດມີຂະໜາດເກີນຄ່າ upload_max_filesize ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນ php.ini."

msgid "The uploaded file exceeds the MAX_FILE_SIZE directive that was specified in the HTML form."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ອັບໂຫລດມີຂະໜາດເກີນຄ່າ MAX_FILE_SIZE ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນຟອມ HTML."

msgid "The uploaded file was only partially uploaded."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ຖືກອັບໂຫລດພຽງບາງສ່ວນເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

msgid "Missing a temporary folder."
msgstr "ບໍ່ພົບໂຟນເດີຊົ່ວຄາວ."

msgid "Failed to write file to disk."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດຂຽນໄຟລ໌ລົງໃນດິສກ໌ໄດ້."

msgid "File upload stopped by extension."
msgstr "ການອັບໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ຖືກຢຸດໂດຍສ່ວນເສີມ (extension)."

msgid "Unknown error in file upload."
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກໃນການອັບໂຫລດໄຟລ໌."

msgid "File is a symbolic link"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ເປັນລິ້ງສັນຍະລັກ (symbolic link)"

msgid "File could not be read!"
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານໄຟລ໌ໄດ້!"

msgid "Error moving the uploaded file, see [doc@faq1-11]FAQ 1.11[/doc]."
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນການຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ທີ່ອັບໂຫລດ, ເບິ່ງ [doc@faq1-11]FAQ 1.11[/doc]."

msgid "Cannot create temporary file."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດສ້າງໄຟລ໌ຊົ່ວຄາວໄດ້."

msgid "Error while moving uploaded file."
msgstr "ເກີດຂໍ້ຜິດພາດໃນຂະນະທີ່ຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ທີ່ອັບໂຫລດ."

msgid "Cannot read uploaded file."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານໄຟລ໌ທີ່ອັບໂຫລດໄດ້."

msgid "You attempted to load file with unsupported compression (%s). Either support for it is not implemented or disabled by your configuration."
msgstr "ເຈົ້າພະຍາຍາມໂຫລດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ມີການບີບອັດທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ (%s). ອາດຈະຍັງບໍ່ທັນມີການຮອງຮັບ ຫຼື ຖືກປິດການໃຊ້ງານໄວ້ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງເຈົ້າ."

msgid "Session not found."
msgstr "ບໍ່ພົບເຊດຊັນ (Session)."

msgid "Jump to database “%s”."
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນ “%s”."

msgid "SSL is not being used"
msgstr "ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ SSL"

msgid "SSL is used with disabled verification"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ SSL ໂດຍປິດການກວດສອບ (verification)"

msgid "SSL is used without certification authority"
msgstr "ໃຊ້ SSL ໂດຍບໍ່ມີໃບຢັ້ງຢືນ (CA)"

msgid "SSL is used"
msgstr "ມີການໃຊ້ SSL"

msgid "The PHP function password_hash() with default options."
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນ PHP password_hash() ພ້ອມຕົວເລືອກເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

msgid "password_hash() PHP function"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນ PHP password_hash()"

msgid "Skip Explain SQL"
msgstr "ຂ້າມການອະທິບາຍ SQL (Explain SQL)"

msgid "Skip Analyze SQL"
msgstr "ຂ້າມການວິເຄາະ SQL"

msgid "Without PHP code"
msgstr "ບໍ່ເອົາໂຄ້ດ PHP"

msgctxt "Inline edit query"
msgid "Edit inline"
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂໃນແຖວ"

msgid "Static analysis:"
msgstr "ການວິເຄາະຄົງທີ່ (Static analysis):"

msgid "%d errors were found during analysis."
msgstr "ພົບຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ %d ລາຍການລະຫວ່າງການວິເຄາະ."

msgid "You should upgrade to %s %s or later."
msgstr "ທ່ານຄວນອັບເກຣດເປັນ %s %s ຫຼື ເວີຊັນໃໝ່ກວ່າ."

msgid "See %sour documentation%s for more information."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງ %sເອກະສານ%s ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ."

msgid "GLOBALS overwrite attempt"
msgstr "ພະຍາຍາມຂຽນທັບ GLOBALS"

msgid "possible exploit"
msgstr "ອາດເປັນການໂຈມຕີລະບົບ"

msgid "The ini_get and/or ini_set functions are disabled in php.ini. phpMyAdmin requires these functions!"
msgstr "ຟັງຊັນ ini_get ແລະ/ຫຼື ini_set ຖືກປິດໃຊ້ງານໃນ php.ini. phpMyAdmin ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຟັງຊັນເຫຼົ່ານີ້!"

msgid "Error: Token mismatch"
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: ໂທເຄັນ (Token) ບໍ່ກົງກັນ"

msgid "Failed to set session cookie. Maybe you are using HTTP instead of HTTPS to access phpMyAdmin."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊດຊັນຄຸກກີ້ (session cookie) ບໍ່ສຳເລັດ. ບາງທີທ່ານອາດຈະໃຊ້ HTTP ແທນ HTTPS ເພື່ອເຂົ້າໃຊ້ phpMyAdmin."

msgid "Ignoring unsupported language code."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສົນໃຈລະຫັດພາສາທີ່ບໍ່ຮອງຮັບ."

msgid "The database name must be a non-empty string."
msgstr "ຊື່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນຕ້ອງບໍ່ເປັນຄ່າຫວ່າງ."

msgid "The database name cannot be longer than %d characters."
msgstr "ຊື່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ສາມາດຍາວກວ່າ %d ຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid "The database name cannot end with a space character."
msgstr "ຊື່ຖານຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ສາມາດລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນຫວ່າງ (space)."

msgid "The table name must be a non-empty string."
msgstr "ຊື່ຕາຕະລາງຕ້ອງບໍ່ເປັນຄ່າຫວ່າງ."

msgid "The table name cannot be longer than %d characters."
msgstr "ຊື່ຕາຕະລາງບໍ່ສາມາດຍາວກວ່າ %d ຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid "The table name cannot end with a space character."
msgstr "ຊື່ຕາຕະລາງບໍ່ສາມາດລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນຫວ່າງ (space)."

msgid "The trigger name must not be empty."
msgstr "ຊື່ທຣິກເກີ (trigger) ຕ້ອງບໍ່ເປັນຄ່າຫວ່າງ."

msgid "The trigger name cannot be longer than %d characters."
msgstr "ຊື່ທຣິກເກີບໍ່ສາມາດຍາວກວ່າ %d ຕົວອັກສອນ."

msgid "The trigger name cannot end with a space character."
msgstr "ຊື່ທຣິກເກີບໍ່ສາມາດລົງທ້າຍດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນຫວ່າງ (space)."

msgid "Only INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, REPLACE and SET (without options like GLOBAL) SQL queries containing transactional engine tables can be rolled back."
msgstr "ສະເພາະຄຳສັ່ງ SQL ປະເພດ INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE, REPLACE ແລະ SET (ໂດຍບໍ່ມີຕົວເລືອກ GLOBAL) ທີ່ໃຊ້ຕາຕະລາງແບບ transactional engine ເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ສາມາດຍົກເລີກການປ່ຽນແປງ (roll back) ໄດ້."

msgid "Go to table: %s"
msgstr "ໄປທີ່ຕາຕະລາງ: %s"

msgid "Structure of %s"
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງຂອງ %s"

